WEBVTT

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:15.460
Faria?

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:21.870
The first librarian, Genius, 
who sold his soul to Physis long ago...

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:26.490
To think you were the one 
who formed a contract with him.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.380
The curse of the old library 
locks a person in time

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.880
and destroys their very existence.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.390
I suppose that was Genius's power.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:42.730
I see now why Germain referred 
to you as the Son of Destruction.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.600
That's right.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:46.740
Gareth...

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:55.150
The one using the power of Physis 
to bring calamity to our school...

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.800
It was <i>you</i>.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:34.860
<b>Conviction\h\h\h-Punishment-</b>

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:41.640
Nemo's been fighting for us this whole time!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:46.180
These are the results of an investigation 
by Sophitia and the board.

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:52.500
Those three "artificial successors" 
you met at Burgot Volcano...

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.590
are fundamentally similar to Nemo.

00:02:56.590 --> 00:03:01.880
Meaning their comrade Nemo made 
a contract with the cursed hero Genius

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.660
and infiltrated the school.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.730
I'll admit he bears a resemblance

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:10.370
to the hero from the old school records.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.000
But the curse of the old library 
existed before Nemo ever showed up.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.610
The curse was sealed by Eunomia in the past.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:20.630
But...

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:25.660
If present, Genius himself could release it!

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.140
Precisely.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.820
The curse of the old library killed Claire.

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:34.340
A curse that was once sealed away...

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:43.160
I can't deny the weirdness kicked off
with Nemo's arrival.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.880
The dead dragon's revival,

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.710
Gildan's possession,

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.160
Physis's infiltration of the school...

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.750
It's true he was here for all that.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:57.480
But it's still a big jump to assume
 he caused it all!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.800
Nemo could be a victim of Physis, too.

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:03.880
An undeniable possibility.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.440
That's why we're only confining him.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:07.980
What do you mean?

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:10.930
If we release him now,

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.520
it could ignite panic amongst the students.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.810
That's not what I'm after.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.610
I just want to know the truth.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:29.340
His power is so immense... and so unusual.

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:37.790
Part of the reason I kept him close
 was to get a better read on it.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.000
So that's that?!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.010
He's our friend, isn't he?

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.100
Yes, he's our friend.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.140
But if he's really with Physis, 
I gotta side with the school.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.030
Jou is right.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.390
I just go with the flow, so...

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.190
Fine.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.130
Then I'll save Nemo myself.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:05.820
Nemo...

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:13.810
Don't even try to call Genius.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.650
That magic circle prevents succession.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:23.460
This dorm was partly founded as a prison 
to seal in dangerous successors like you.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:27.430
I have no intention of using my succession.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:31.090
I don't want to fight any of you.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:32.850
Liar!

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.930
Then what is the meaning 
of that corrupt arm?!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.390
It reflects my sin.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:48.450
Killing Claire?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.450
No.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:52.080
I had no part in her death.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.610
Then what's this "sin" you speak of?!

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:02.620
I am an artificial successor
 created by Physis.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.190
I was born in that base,

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:20.610
alongside many brothers and sisters...

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.970
Number eight is a failure as well.

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:46.750
I'm acting in accordance with the prophecy.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.050
Why is it not working?

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:51.660
I'll adjust the proportions of the bath.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:54.250
We should be able to find a balance.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:58.000
We'll try that tomorrow.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.240
Now let us make haste.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:04.400
<i>Are you afraid of death?</i>

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:06.270
<i>Afraid?</i>

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:08.180
<i>Fear is fundamental to humanity.</i>

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:12.410
<i>It's what allows people 
to love themselves and others.</i>

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:13.840
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:15.450
<i>What are you telling me?</i>

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.410
<i>Speak thy heart's desire.</i>

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.920
<i>I want... to live!</i>

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:33.050
So you became the boy named Nemo
and made your way here?

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.050
Because I wanted to be here.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.520
With Faria and you all.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:40.680
Nemo...

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.560
That's it?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:46.520
You pretended to be human for <i>that?!</i>

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.320
You expect me to believe you?

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.020
I don't blame you.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.450
If I were you, I wouldn't believe it either.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.330
So go ahead and kill me.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.800
I don't want to fight any of you.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.710
In that case...

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:11.100
No.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.630
I'll let you live for now.

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:18.640
I'll only kill you when the appropriate 
judgment has been reached.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:26.890
I...

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.650
Hey, Ellen...

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.280
What do you really think?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:38.780
About Nemo? 
You doubted him too, didn't you?

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:42.140
But the timing seems too convenient.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.790
I understand how Gareth feels, but...

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:46.420
Stop right there.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.290
But...

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:53.040
If you say any more, 
you'll fall under suspicion, too.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.300
We don't want that, now do we,

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.580
head of the disciplinary committee?

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:04.280
Still, Nemo risked his life to save me.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.560
So I should return the favor.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.750
Ah, I get it now.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.570
Nemo's important to you.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:12.820
I...

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:17.570
It's okay. As you know, 
I just go with the flow.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.730
You really are devious.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:27.330
<i>So very devious...</i>

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:33.660
Jou.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.190
Trying the student affairs committee, huh?

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:40.180
I forgot you were close 
with the vice chairman.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.290
There's no way that Nemo 
is working for Physis.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:47.700
I'll do whatever it takes to save him.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.190
Let's have a little chat.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.030
You and I go way back.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.850
I remember how freakin' terrified 
you were on your first deployment.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.620
Never thought we'd get ourselves
a real prince in the Seven Knights.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:10.330
And who was it that got his butt saved 
by a terrified prince on that deployment?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.890
Me.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:18.840
Hey... you didn't bring me out here
 to reminisce about old times.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.400
Let's talk about Nemo.

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:25.180
We know that Nemo's a good guy.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.600
How is that not enough?

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:34.200
Don't forget that Physis killed 
my dad, our classmates, and Claire.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:37.010
I hate Physis just as much.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.740
But you're just assuming
 that he's one of them.

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:44.120
You saw his arm.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.620
That was...

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.360
My ears aren't human, either.

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:51.880
That doesn't make me part of Physis.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:53.580
I get it.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.290
I know he's a good guy.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:56.940
But...

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:58.880
I...

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:03.400
have this feeling he's been 
lying to us all this time.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.400
Tell me now, Lady Eunomia.

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:15.340
What happened in the old library?

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.900
<i>Behold, Faria.</i>

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:24.410
That's... the same curse 
that affected Claire!

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.660
So Genius did the same to you?

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:31.080
<i>If you dig any deeper into the truth,</i>

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.670
<i>you will surely be affected as well.</i>

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:38.200
<i>Are you prepared to risk 
everything to save him?</i>

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:40.160
I want...

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.740
I want to help Nemo.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:48.400
I can't bear to see him executed.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.680
Lady Eunomia!

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:56.200
<i>Is there no doubt in those words?</i>

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:57.630
None.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:00.620
<i>Then I shall take you</i>

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.660
<i>back to where it all began.</i>

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:07.740
<i>To the one who holds the answers you seek.</i>

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:30.570
Where it all began...

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.810
A book?

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:46.270
<i>Is this... the truth?</i>

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.460
I-I don't know what you want from me.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:04.420
It was the student council that 
first placed suspicion on him...

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:05.970
But it's <i>just</i> suspicion.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:12.970
My job is to respect the rules,
 not to break them.

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:17.500
I'm not asking you to break any rules.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.230
R-Really, Gildan...

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.650
Sir,

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:25.320
you made a bad investment and
 have a lot of outstanding debt, no?

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:27.110
Where did you learn that?

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:31.120
A prince has his ways.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:37.020
Now, I think my country can
 help you out of your jam.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.730
I-I'll do what I can.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:45.540
But I can't guarantee anything
 more than that.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.090
Thanks so much!

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:55.240
What is it, chairwoman?

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:57.100
Were you listening in?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:57.890
Indeed.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:00.900
I don't think what I'm doing is wrong.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.150
I know.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.260
Justice always triumphs.

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:10.600
But <i>whose</i> justice? That's the question.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:12.530
Shirley?

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:16.970
So I'm going to make sure 
it is <i>our</i> justice that triumphs.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:19.820
Right!

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.630
Damn it. I...

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.640
Are you feeling in doubt?

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:38.760
Miss Sophitia!

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:42.400
I'd be happy to hear your troubles.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.500
Y-Yeah...

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.900
I don't know what to do.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.320
He might be with Physis.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.720
But he's also a good guy.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.510
M-Miss Sophitia?!

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:01.500
You're so nice, Jou.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.940
Personally...

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:11.380
I believe a nice boy like you
could save us all.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.640
Please stop!

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:15.390
Jou...

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:20.230
I-I mean... I'll do all I can 
to protect you, Miss Sophitia.

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:22.550
So just leave things to me.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:29.750
You're exactly the man I hoped you were.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:43.070
<i>When I became Nemo...</i>

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:53.390
Are you all right?

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:54.780
Who are you?

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:06.990
This is the house where Nemo was born.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.170
Little bugs who—

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.700
Is this...

00:16:58.320 --> 00:16:59.120
You're...

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:02.110
Reda of Physis!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.010
I almost had you.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:06.940
I should've known the Seven Knights
 would track me down!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.960
You're wrong. I'm—

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:09.880
Shut up!

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.300
Succession!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:21.600
I can't afford to die here!

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:50.210
Purification Thunderfire!

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.280
That's enough.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.640
Give yourself up.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:00.600
Are you mad?

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:05.600
I know what you do to people like me.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:11.860
If I'm going to be humiliated 
and executed anyway, I'd rather...

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.360
You still have that much strength?

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:17.360
Irene! Grant me power!

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:24.240
<i>Cursed child.</i>

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.370
<i>You whose life was forged
 hand-in-hand with rage.</i>

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:31.000
<i>I acknowledge your anger.</i>

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.150
I...

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:41.930
I'm not dying yet!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.560
Irene!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:51.540
<i>Fight. Set your soul ablaze!</i>

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:57.400
<i>That fire shall make you a true warrior!</i>

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.030
Wait! You're—

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:03.780
Silence!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:17.330
So you refuse to tell us anything?

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.220
I'm sorry.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.710
I really don't know anything.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.920
He's made his statement.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.040
He has no intention of confessing.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:29.850
I suggest we execute him to contain 
any further spread of the curse.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.100
I suppose we have no choice.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.980
I agree with Miss Sophitia.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:38.340
I approve.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:40.820
This is for the sake of the Empire of Light

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.250
and the peace of our lands.

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:44.170
Wait!

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:46.640
Shirley?!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:47.740
Both of you!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.530
An imperial order from the mainland.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:55.380
A stay of execution.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.300
What?

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.880
You lack evidence, Gareth.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:01.260
Is this the will of the 
disciplinary committee?

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.760
It is <i>my</i> will.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:07.640
Headmaster, you cannot defy
 the empire's decree!

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.390
Please reconsider this!

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:13.520
Wh-What do you think, headmaster?

00:20:14.350 --> 00:20:18.400
The order has arrived too late.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.280
No!

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.280
I see.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.780
So that's the deal, huh?

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:29.660
I shall take responsibility for the fallout.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.770
We must destroy him now.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.130
Wait!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:39.820
President!

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:42.290
What is the meaning of this?

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.510
I have learned the truth.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.760
And it's made something clear.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.390
What?

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.940
Do you know what this is?

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:56.770
That's...

00:20:57.130 --> 00:21:01.650
It's a memento of Nemo's, the boy you killed.

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.370
Nemo...

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:04.650
...killed Nemo?

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:09.530
You killed the real Nemo 
and came to this school.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.740
Then Nemo really <i>is</i> working for Physis!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.110
That's right, Faria.

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:25.680
I killed him, stealing his form and memories.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.680
You finally admitted it.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:38.080
Then kill me now, Faria.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.250
This will end it all.

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:44.870
Don't be ridiculous, Nemo.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.330
I told you...

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:53.880
that I would protect you!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.090
I won't let you have Nemo.

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:29.220
President... You can't be serious!

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:29.970
Oh, but I am.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:31.930
I'm always serious!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:32.750
Faria...

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:35.850
The real fight is about to start, Nemo.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.680
Next time: "Counterattack."

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Reprisal -Counterattack-</b>

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:39.730
I'm not giving up yet!
